(7021883, 1065037, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, technically superb, and conveying of demonic glee.<br/>It is funny, it is funny, it is funny ... sorry I have to lighten up and accept that as I would have done last month .. but in my town a young mother was savagely murdered in the presence of her 4 year old by a parolee who should have still been serving time for rape with violence. <br/>Sorry, maybe sharing that is inappropriate. <br/>10 for the brilliant image.</td>', 'Excellent photo, technically superb, and conveying of demonic glee.It is funny, it is funny, it is funny ... sorry I have to lighten up and accept that as I would have done last month .. but in my town a young mother was savagely murdered in the presence of her 4 year old by a parolee who should have still been serving time for rape with violence. Sorry, maybe sharing that is inappropriate. 10 for the brilliant image.', '2013-04-17 02:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7021884, 1065037, 160683, '<td valign="top">I believe this is the visage of Mr. Strike. It has the hard edge processing he uses occasionally to very great affect. Although I can''t fathom why the letter mentions Langdon. With that face I would certainly be in fear had I testified at his trial! I can see the gibbering, maniacal, glee for bloodlust in that face. I''m scared!  Nice one!  Whomever you are.</td>', 'I believe this is the visage of Mr. Strike. It has the hard edge processing he uses occasionally to very great affect. Although I can''t fathom why the letter mentions Langdon. With that face I would certainly be in fear had I testified at his trial! I can see the gibbering, maniacal, glee for bloodlust in that face. I''m scared!  Nice one!  Whomever you are.', '2013-04-17 02:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
