(7022013, 1063880, 138253, '<td valign="top">gotta call this one as DNMC to me. this does not capture emotion. this captures silhouettes and may try to force a recall of emotion through the title/image combination, but you could equally call this "loneliness" or "fear of the coming darkness" and still have people react through the title.<br/> <br/>it''s definitely a pretty picture and i''m sure will score well for you as a result, but not from me. (sorry, good try though)</td>', 'gotta call this one as DNMC to me. this does not capture emotion. this captures silhouettes and may try to force a recall of emotion through the title/image combination, but you could equally call this "loneliness" or "fear of the coming darkness" and still have people react through the title. it''s definitely a pretty picture and i''m sure will score well for you as a result, but not from me. (sorry, good try though)', '2013-04-17 09:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
