(7024817, 1064863, 104009, '<td valign="top">ok i''ve been looking for a while now, and that''s a good thing right?  i can''t convince myself that ISN''T a panda bear in the reflection.  it''s so disjointed an unusual, i don''t know how to put this story together, but i want to.  marvelous.</td>', 'ok i''ve been looking for a while now, and that''s a good thing right?  i can''t convince myself that ISN''T a panda bear in the reflection.  it''s so disjointed an unusual, i don''t know how to put this story together, but i want to.  marvelous.', '2013-04-22 09:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024819, 1065033, 104009, '<td valign="top">i think if you''d have cropped out the floor and the distracting red thing, this would have done better than it likely will.  i like the main subjects and its well done, just needed to be tighter in my opinion.</td>', 'i think if you''d have cropped out the floor and the distracting red thing, this would have done better than it likely will.  i like the main subjects and its well done, just needed to be tighter in my opinion.', '2013-04-22 10:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
