(7025118, 1064331, 18367, '<td valign="top">Definitely the most compelling of images I have seen to date.  I have no idea where or when you took this photo, but even if it staged this person has managed to display the raw emotions normally associated with fear and submission.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done... I do hope the voters will deem this worthy of the front page.<br/> <br/>A 9 from me.</td>', 'Definitely the most compelling of images I have seen to date.  I have no idea where or when you took this photo, but even if it staged this person has managed to display the raw emotions normally associated with fear and submission. Very nicely done... I do hope the voters will deem this worthy of the front page. A 9 from me.', '2013-04-22 19:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
