(7025661, 1065037, 30861, '<td valign="top">At least you''re not flippin'' us the bird :-) Nicely done! Just for the record, BTW, yours is the 2nd-highest score I gave in this challenge. Mwah!</td>', 'At least you''re not flippin'' us the bird :-) Nicely done! Just for the record, BTW, yours is the 2nd-highest score I gave in this challenge. Mwah!', '2013-04-23 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025662, 1063817, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is beyond genuine. It''s one of two 10''s I gave in the voting, earlier. I mean, the sadness/despair here is just palpable. I honestly believe it''ll be a travesty if this doesn''t make the front page, though I fear there''s scant hope of that...</td>', 'This is beyond genuine. It''s one of two 10''s I gave in the voting, earlier. I mean, the sadness/despair here is just palpable. I honestly believe it''ll be a travesty if this doesn''t make the front page, though I fear there''s scant hope of that...', '2013-04-23 19:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025673, 1065068, 152252, '<td valign="top">I really love it! The guy looks super happy/optimistic. Good composition. Nice crowd of younger people behind him (man I need to start working out). The blurry background and your choice of b&amp;w made it even better. Nice!</td>', 'I really love it! The guy looks super happy/optimistic. Good composition. Nice crowd of younger people behind him (man I need to start working out). The blurry background and your choice of b&w made it even better. Nice!', '2013-04-23 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025675, 1064826, 152252, '<td valign="top">I remember going for a field trip to Auschwitz (O&amp;#347;wi&amp;#281;cim) once, when I was 11. I never went back because my first experience was so sad. This picture brings a lot of emotions, especially that both my grandparents were in the army during WWII. I don''t even know what to say about the picture right now because it''s definitely too emotional to me. Thanks for taking it though.</td>', 'I remember going for a field trip to Auschwitz (O&#347;wi&#281;cim) once, when I was 11. I never went back because my first experience was so sad. This picture brings a lot of emotions, especially that both my grandparents were in the army during WWII. I don''t even know what to say about the picture right now because it''s definitely too emotional to me. Thanks for taking it though.', '2013-04-23 19:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025676, 1065007, 152252, '<td valign="top">Actually to me it looks more like he is reflecting on something which is better than boredom (imo). Good capture.</td>', 'Actually to me it looks more like he is reflecting on something which is better than boredom (imo). Good capture.', '2013-04-23 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025682, 1064200, 152252, '<td valign="top">That''s a great contrast between the two. The light is also great, only the main subjects are not in the shadow. I love how the shadow divides the two stories/emotions from each other. Pretty Jagarish (this word should be in dictionaries already :)</td>', 'That''s a great contrast between the two. The light is also great, only the main subjects are not in the shadow. I love how the shadow divides the two stories/emotions from each other. Pretty Jagarish (this word should be in dictionaries already :)', '2013-04-23 19:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025721, 1064906, 152252, '<td valign="top">Amazing portrait. Great model, light and post processing.</td>', 'Amazing portrait. Great model, light and post processing.', '2013-04-23 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025722, 1064921, 152252, '<td valign="top">You have some great facial expressions Sir. I didn''t know bears are so good at this.</td>', 'You have some great facial expressions Sir. I didn''t know bears are so good at this.', '2013-04-23 20:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7025723, 1065078, 152252, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny (or mean?). I never had a camera ready to take a picture like this. Did you piss someone off on purpose waiting with your camera? :)</td>', 'That''s too funny (or mean?). I never had a camera ready to take a picture like this. Did you piss someone off on purpose waiting with your camera? :)', '2013-04-23 20:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
