(7026040, 1064845, 138253, '<td valign="top">Thank you :)<br/>I will say though, its hard to get action shots of strangers expressing emotion. I was 15ft up in the food court on lunch when she came in the main doors. Relied on auto focus and it missed the mark. Ah well... should''ve gone for higher aperature value and brightened in PP... harder to fix focus. Lessonlearned :)<br/>I was hoping for a mid 5 with this (5.4-5.65). Tpl seems to be critical on my entries. Only way to Iimprove though, really.</td>', 'Thank you :)I will say though, its hard to get action shots of strangers expressing emotion. I was 15ft up in the food court on lunch when she came in the main doors. Relied on auto focus and it missed the mark. Ah well... should''ve gone for higher aperature value and brightened in PP... harder to fix focus. Lessonlearned :)I was hoping for a mid 5 with this (5.4-5.65). Tpl seems to be critical on my entries. Only way to Iimprove though, really.', '2013-04-24 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
