(7026129, 1065019, 103142, '<td valign="top">Didn''t have an entry, but did have a play. I''m part of a theater group at our church. We have been doing it for close to 8 years now.<br/> <br/>I took this for an advertisement for the newspaper. The one in green is my daughter.<br/> <br/>It runs this weekend: dinner theater.<br/> <br/>So I figured I''d use this. But was greed an emotion? According to psych 101 it is, another site, no. It turns out that half the sites say yes, half say no. :)</td>', 'Didn''t have an entry, but did have a play. I''m part of a theater group at our church. We have been doing it for close to 8 years now. I took this for an advertisement for the newspaper. The one in green is my daughter. It runs this weekend: dinner theater. So I figured I''d use this. But was greed an emotion? According to psych 101 it is, another site, no. It turns out that half the sites say yes, half say no. :)', '2013-04-24 07:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
